# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for `cargo xtask sanitizers` (thread runs).
# Each entry names a reviewed false positive; see
# docs/qualification/sanitizers-2026-10-15.md.
#
# Darwin keeps errno in the pthread structure at the top of each thread's
# stack allocation. libsystem is not instrumented, so when a finished thread's
# allocation is reused for a new thread TSan sees two different threads touch
# the same errno word without a happens-before edge. errno is thread-local;
# observed between a libtest thread's TempDir cleanup and a later
# deadpan-jobs stderr pump thread (std's io::Error::last_os_error).
race:3std3sys2io5error4unix5errno
race:3std3sys2io5error4unix9set_errno
